,"References",null],"uses":{}},{"type":"data","data":[{"doc":1,"prev":11,"next":14},{"slug":2,"num":3,"title":4,"html":5,"toc":6,"summary":10},"development",26,"Development","\u003Cdiv class=\"code-block\" data-lang=\"bash\">\u003Cpre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">make\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # build the web console, then go build\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">make\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> web\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # build the web console only\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">make\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> web-dev\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # Vite dev server; run pgha console for the API\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">make\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> site\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # build the documentation site into site/build\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">make\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> site-dev\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # documentation site with live reload\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">make\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # go test ./... and svelte-check\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">make\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lint\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # go vet ./...\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">make\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> snapshot\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # goreleaser snapshot into ./dist\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">make\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> image\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # container image pgha:dev from the Dockerfile\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>A tag \u003Ccode>v*\u003C/code> publishes the release and the container image\n\u003Ccode>ghcr.io/mantissatech/pgha\u003C/code>. The README section &quot;Releases&quot; lists the\ntoken, the public repository, apt, yum, Homebrew, Scoop, and the image.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"documentation-site\">\u003Ca class=\"anchor\" href=\"#documentation-site\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#\u003C/a>Documentation site\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>This file is the source of \u003Ca href=\"https://mantissatech.github.io/pgha-cli/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://mantissatech.github.io/pgha-cli/\u003C/a>. The\nSvelteKit app in \u003Ccode>site/\u003C/code> splits it at each \u003Ccode>##\u003C/code> heading into one page, and\nbuilds static HTML at build time. Each \u003Ccode>###\u003C/code> heading is in the &quot;On this page&quot;\nlist and in the search.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Links such as \u003Ccode>[Backups](#16-backups)\u003C/code> go to the right page. The build\nfails on a link to a heading that does not exist.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>The \u003Ccode>Docs\u003C/code> workflow builds the site on each pull request. On \u003Ccode>main\u003C/code> it runs\n\u003Ccode>scripts/publish-docs.sh\u003C/code>, which copies the site to the \u003Ccode>gh-pages\u003C/code> branch of\n\u003Ccode>mantissatech/pgha-cli\u003C/code>.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>That branch also holds the apt and yum repositories. The script changes\nonly the files listed in \u003Ccode>.pgha-docs-files\u003C/code>. It never changes \u003Ccode>dists/\u003C/code>,\n\u003Ccode>pool/\u003C/code>, \u003Ccode>yum/\u003C/code>, \u003Ccode>README.md\u003C/code>, \u003Ccode>.nojekyll\u003C/code> or the archive key.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>Tests that need local services are off by default:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"table-wrap\">\u003Ctable>\u003Cthead>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth>Variable\u003C/th>\u003Cth>Test\u003C/th>\u003Cth>Needs\u003C/th>\u003C/tr>\u003C/thead>\u003Ctbody>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>\u003Ccode>PGHA_TEST_SOURCE_URL\u003C/code>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ccode>TestImportLocal\u003C/code>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Local Postgres, a source database with a table \u003Ccode>orders\u003C/code>\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>\u003Ccode>PGHA_TEST_POOLER=1\u003C/code>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ccode>TestPooledLocal\u003C/code>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Local Postgres and PgBouncer on port 6432\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003C/tbody>\u003C/table>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>Code rules used in this project:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Comments have 7 words or fewer.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Function names have 4 words or fewer.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>User messages have 10 words or fewer.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Use \u003Ccode>context.Context\u003C/code> in all calls that do I/O.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Check all values before they go into a shell command or SQL text.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n",[7],{"id":8,"text":9},"documentation-site","Documentation site","A tag v publishes the release and the container image ghcr.io/mantissatech/pgha. The README section \"Releases\" lists the token, the public repository, apt, y…",{"slug":12,"title":13},"code-structure","Code structure",{"slug":15,"title":16},"references","References"],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
